sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Learner as Student Learner
    participant Router as PickupsRouter
    participant Service as PickupService
    participant DB as MongoDB (PyMongo)

    Learner->>Router: POST /packages/42/request-pickup
    Router->>Service: generate_pickup_code(42, user)
    Service->>DB: find_one({id: 42, recipient_user_id: user.id})
    DB-->>Service: package doc (status = READY_FOR_PICKUP)
    Service->>DB: update_many({package_id: 42, used_at: null}, {$set: {used_at: now}})
    Note over Service: Revokes any prior active token
    Service->>Service: crypto.random_code(6 digits) + salted HMAC-SHA256
    Service->>DB: insert_one(pickup_tokens, {token_hash, expires_at: +30m})
    DB-->>Service: {id: 301, ok: 1}
    Service-->>Router: plaintext_code = "849201"
    Router-->>Learner: 200 OK (Single-use Code: "849201", expires in 30m)
